Date: Sat, 14 Nov 2026 13:33:54 +0000
Subject: [PATCH 1/2] fix(v2): give tests their own local D1 state (#159)

Tests defaulted to the dev .wrangler/state, so they collided with the dev
server (SQLITE_BUSY) and left rows in the dev store. A vitest globalSetup now
points WRANGLER_PERSIST_DIR at a per-run temp dir for apps/v2 and packages/db.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
Claude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01Cv4a6DRnNXdGwnDbUv9bT3
